    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/00ecf12a4c7311c164decda39de3876a.poster.avif?t=1754729474\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/00ecf12a4c7311c164decda39de3876a.webm?t=1754729474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/00ecf12a4c7311c164decda39de3876a.mp4?t=1754729474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/b475393b37ac57f6299a93017813cae1.avif?t=1754729474\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide variety of furniture with plenty to choose from, many featuring little interactive surprises. Pull a few tissues, squeeze a rubber ducky, and enjoy the fun of these adorable details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/8da99c5cf0072204109a06c77d454a0a.poster.avif?t=1754729474\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/8da99c5cf0072204109a06c77d454a0a.webm?t=1754729474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/8da99c5cf0072204109a06c77d454a0a.mp4?t=1754729474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/367fc909b300ab956479732cfbddbdc0.avif?t=1754729474\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your space with ease and utilize it as you wish, decorating from floor to wall to create cozy corners full of personality and creativity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/8d4a36e049228ca1ae6e92da6b1c7ea2.poster.avif?t=1754729474\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/8d4a36e049228ca1ae6e92da6b1c7ea2.webm?t=1754729474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/8d4a36e049228ca1ae6e92da6b1c7ea2.mp4?t=1754729474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/7546e7a686a410beb4437b7c01dd57fc.avif?t=1754729474\" width=672 height=448 /></span>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p cla